"""
xAquaticRisk Control Panel â€” unified web server.

Merges the parameterisation editor (WebUI) and run monitoring dashboard
into a single application served from one HTTP port.

Endpoints
~~~~~~~~~
    Static
        GET  /                          â†’ index.html
    Parameterisation
        GET  /api/template              â†’ parsed template.xrun with metadata
        GET  /api/scenarios             â†’ available landscape scenarios
        POST /api/run                   â†’ create xrun & launch __start__.bat
        POST /api/save                  â†’ save current parameterisation
        POST /api/save-as               â†’ save parameterisation to custom file
        POST /api/open-xrun             â†’ load an existing xrun file
        POST /api/xrun-files            â†’ list xrun files in a directory
    Monitoring
        GET  /api/runs                  â†’ list of all simulation runs
        GET  /api/runs/<id>             â†’ detailed run info (includes abortable flag)
        GET  /api/runs/<id>/log/<name>  â†’ tail parsed log entries
        POST /api/runs/<id>/abort       â†’ abort a running simulation

Usage::

    python controlpanel/server.py                       # default port 8090 (or XAQ_PORT env)
    python controlpanel/server.py --port 9000            # custom port
    python controlpanel/server.py --run-dir C:/other     # custom run folder
"""

